As many of you are aware, that 2nd/3rd January 2013 is the 25th Anniversary 
of lojban's creation. We have decided to hold a special logfest, 
celebrating the 25 years of lojban.

The logfest is proposed to happen in Fairfax, VA on 2nd and 3rd January.

Please notify us if you plan to attend, as adequate arrangements need to be 
made.

